<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<body>
  <main class="about-container">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <h1>About Bookify</h1>
      <p>Your trusted online bookstore for everything from bestsellers to academic texts.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- About Details Section -->
    <section class="about-details">
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>Bookify is more than just a bookstore – it’s a community of readers, developers, and dreamers. 
         Founded with a deep love for books and modern web technology, our goal is to bring the magic of books to your fingertips with ease and affordability.</p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>We aim to make reading accessible and enjoyable for everyone. Whether you're a student, a professional, or a casual reader, 
         Bookify has something for you. We are committed to promoting the culture of reading in the digital era.</p>

      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Thousands of books across all genres: fiction, non-fiction, self-help, biographies, academics, and more</li>
        <li>Fast and secure checkout with multiple payment options</li>
        <li>Affordable prices with seasonal offers and discounts</li>
        <li>Personalized book suggestions based on your interests</li>
        <li>Clean, user-friendly interface with detailed previews</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Choose Bookify?</h2>
      <p>We believe in building a platform that’s simple, fast, and delightful to use. With intuitive navigation, helpful customer support, 
         and a constantly expanding catalog, Bookify is designed to become your favorite destination for books online.</p>

      <p><strong>Let’s build a reading culture – one book at a time.</strong></p>
    </section>

    <!-- Newsletter Section -->
    <section class="newsletter-section">
      <h2>📬 Join Our Newsletter</h2>
      <p>Stay updated with the latest book releases, discounts, and reading tips. Subscribe now and never miss a story!</p>
      
      <form action="/subscribe" method="POST" class="newsletter-form">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
        <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
